    "sections": {
        "description": "Kitchence is a sleek, SEO-optimized eCommerce theme designed for WooCommerce and powered by the WC Booster plugin, offering fast loading and enhanced visibility on Google. Ideal for online fashion retailers, it features seamless payment integration and a user-friendly, Gutenberg-compatible design that lets you build a professional website in minutes—no coding required. Packed with powerful features like WooCommerce compatibility, a category collage, product sliders, and a stylish gallery, Kitchence makes creating a high-performing online store effortless. See the real demo site at  https://demos.eaglevisionit.com/kitchence/"
    },
